WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Old messages are optional. Use More → Import old chats (JAR Bridge).

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Choose Chat history → History file. This path does not need the JAR app.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Load your history export and choose its matching character from your library.

4
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Import chat saves the conversation under your chosen character.

5
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.600
Choose Continue chat. Your old messages open as a normal saved conversation.
